. Uploading now."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Dandelion, when will Machlian wake up?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dandelion","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She'll regain consciousness in about five minutes. Are you going to resume the interrogation?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kolibri","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kolibri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander's so cruel..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Derringer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Derringer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Good thing we're on the Commander's side!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're getting the wrong idea about the Commander..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Fedorov","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Fedorov","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander... Doesn't Machlian deserve to know that we hacked into her memories?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Kolibri","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kolibri","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, we Dolls hate people snooping around in our memories without permission."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Derringer","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Derringer","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"After all, memories are very important to us."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{